==Trivia==
*The text on its body is ネコケシ ''Neko Keshi'' (Cat Eraser) written in sideways katakana.
*Malevolent Eraser Cat has the highest health of all non-collab enemies in the game at 100% strength magnification, beating out the long-time previous holders [[Manic Mohawk Cat (Enemy)|Manic Mohawk]] and [[Manic Eraser Cat (Enemy)|Manic Eraser Cat]], and the second highest overall behind [[Nutcracker Witch (Enemy)|Nutcracker Witch]].

